            "description": "Normal: < 100 connections (green). Watch for: sustained > 500 (red) may indicate connection leaks or missing disconnects. Check next: server-golden-signals for overall resource pressure.",
            "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {
                    "links": [
                        {
                            "targetBlank": true,
